Description: Scrapes details related to chemicals from the [Evaluations of
    the Joint FAO/WHO Expert Committee on Food Additives
    (JECFA)](https://apps.who.int/food-additives-contaminants-jecfa-database/Home/),
    captures evaluation reports, links, and other data points.
